WEBVTT

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.750
What?

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.620
I-Is this...?

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.410
Blood!

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.910
Wow, holy shit.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.040
Blood? What the hell?

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.910
Onstagram?

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.370
I started it, too.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.200
I followed you.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.200
No way.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.660
"Lucy Morstan (Click to Follow)"

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.660
You're right.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.660
My sister... on Onstagram?

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:14.370
Um, there's someone I want to introduce you to.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:15.200
Who?

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:20.080
My partner... Well, I'll tell you more later.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.500
Anyway, I'll be back later.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:34.040
That rain of blood yesterday
was just water, they say.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.870
So was it a prank?

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:39.870
There wasn't any sign
it came from a nearby building.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.750
So it's a total mystery.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:46.700
Oh, right. I need to put the laundry up to dry.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.040
Run the sheets through
the washing machine again.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.790
Sure thing.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:58.950
"'Catch' for Shady Businesses" 
"Client"

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:58.950
What's up, Dilan? It's too early in the
morning for me to fondle a girl's boobs.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:03.200
Shit! Shut up you boob-lover.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.080
I quit being a catch.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:09.410
Today I'm here...

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.950
...as a client!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:47.330
"Where is He?"

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.700
Where's Lucy- <i>san</i> ?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.330
On a date, I think.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.830
Your sister's on a date?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.620
That explains why her skin's
been glowing so much lately.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.910
She's getting her pipe laid, huh?

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.910
Um, can I talk?

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:00.040
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.700
These are the ones interested in helping.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.290
Dilan, why'd you quit your job?

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:10.500
I met Cathy and decided I wanted
to do something that would help others.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.910
Cathy? Who's that?

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:15.290
My fiancée.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.200
You're engaged?

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.700
Are you trying to brag?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.580
She appeared before me without warning.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:27.540
"Cosplay Soap Resort Aiji"

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.830
Glasses! Cat Ears!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.540
We've got it all!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.410
I couldn't get it up at all!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.410
My ED came back thanks to you!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.450
Shaddup!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.410
Go to a urologist five times a week!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:42.250
Hi. I'm Cathy.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.250
"Dilan's Fiancée"

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.750
I was sick of my work,

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.830
and I unloaded all my complaints onto Cathy.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:57.250
As I talked to her, I came to love her.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:01.250
Before we get married, why don't
you find a job that helps others!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:05.450
"Why Not Find a Job That Helps Others?"

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.450
I joined Vision To You,

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.370
and started studying at their seminars,

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.040
and introducing my friends
to healthy productions.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:15.540
It took a lot of money, but it felt
like an investment in my future.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.160
So it's an MLM thing, huh?

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:23.250
And after I made my last deposit to them,

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:25.790
Cathy disappeared.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.580
Did you ask the company?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:31.750
Of course! But nobody listened to me!

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.160
I can't go to the seminars anymore either.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:36.750
Cathy! Where are you?!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.450
I'm so worried!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:41.000
You were tricked.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.580
Yes. The woman was after your money.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.950
Dilan, first quit the group.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.500
Why? If I do, I'll never be able
to see her again! Why?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.870
Calm down.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.290
Sorry, Big Mother.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.200
I just want to know how she feels.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.700
There's a seminar for members tonight.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.370
Cathy might be there.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.160
Okay, kiddo.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:08.040
You want us to infiltrate the seminar
and find out how she feels, right?

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.540
Yes! Please!

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:15.790
Since you don't seem to have
any money, I want something else.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.000
You're an old friend,
so we'll give you a discount.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:23.750
I've got two tickets
for a top-class soap resort!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.750
How about it?

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.200
I'm in! Those boobs are as good as mine!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.000
Wait, you don't go to those places, do you?

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.200
I'm going to make this
my chance to experience a real...

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:37.660
I mean, no a new world!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.660
Oh, that's right, the one person
you slept with was a man--

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.080
Shaddup!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.910
What will you do?

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.500
I want to help him find her.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.540
If that will help him find closure...

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:52.120
Hey, John, want to join me?

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:56.620
My sister's not here today.
So let's work together!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:00.290
Okay, got it!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:05.830
When the sun sets in other towns,
in our town, the neon lights turn on.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:10.750
If you want gold and silver,
find what the vanished girl thinks!

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:15.290
A light shines in the detectives' eyes.
This row house is filled with the strangest of men,

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:19.000
and people call it, "The Detective's Row House."

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.450
For this job, whoever finds out
how Dilan's fiancée, Cathy, really feels,

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:26.580
gets a special ticket to
an ultra-high-class soap resort!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.910
Ready, go!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:32.450
"VTY (Vision To You) Building"

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.450
Um...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.450
I'd like to join your organization.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.410
A wonderful decision!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.620
Join us and experience personal growth,

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.660
and attain true vision!

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:46.500
Sure. Sounds great.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:52.790
"Now You Too Can Be a Vision Master"

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.910
Now, the first step is to have
a brief interview with our CEO.

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.790
We call it Vision Counseling!

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.910
The counseling fee is 10,000 yen apiece.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.910
"Additives Are Poison"

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.830
Ten thousand yen?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.120
The CEO's vision is vast.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.660
Just talking to her will enhance your growth.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:04.500
Enhance...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:12.500
"VTY CEO"

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.870
I am Kimiko Goshogawara.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.500
I am Isshiki, her secretary.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.080
Nice to meet you.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:17.950
Let's get started with your vision counseling.

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:25.620
We're very selective about the kind of people
we allow to represent our brand.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.500
Okay, let's begin.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.200
Congratulations. You both pass!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.160
Huh? That was fast...

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.040
Wasn't it?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.250
I can look at a person's face
and understand their vision.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.540
For instance, the person
we just turned down kept

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.580
asking all kinds of strange questions.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:52.580
Hey, wait!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.830
"Counseling" my ass!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.200
Ten thousand yen?

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.160
Give back my money! Give back my money, you hag!

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:01.950
The poor man is afraid to believe in others.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.950
You tricked me!

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.700
You lying old bitch!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.250
Hatred and rage will lead you nowhere.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:11.080
You must calm your soul
and maintain a gratitude attitude.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:19.540
Now who were you calling
an old bitch? You piece of trash!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:22.620
--Ma'am, that's enough.
--Little shits like you need to be--

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.830
Are you okay?

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.620
We're sorry!

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.700
See him out.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.120
Of course.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.080
I apologize.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:44.660
I'll give you this vision water
to celebrate your joining us.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.080
It's normally 10,000 yen a bottle,

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.000
but first, try it out.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.120
You can use it as a face wash, or drink it.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:57.410
This miraculous water
will warm your body and soul.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.040
"John H Watson"

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.660
I'm a member, seriously!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.540
Don't judge me by my face!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:13.660
Ow!

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:16.790
And as I ate this tiny piece of bread,

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:22.250
I realized how important vision is in life.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:28.950
Are you all ready, then?

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.790
Three, two, one!

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:35.250
Vision!

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.290
Wonderful!

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:47.750
Now, as you now, last night
we held a test of the vision rain.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.870
The test of the colorized liquid was a success.

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:55.790
And next week we'll be doing full-scale
operations with the vision water!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.750
As partners, let's all work together

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:01.750
to bring the rain of happiness down on Shinjuku.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:09.950
Now we'll have a report
from Cathy, a gold partner.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.120
Hello. I'm Cathy!

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.660
Did you all know that VTY has another meaning?

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:22.410
That meaning is "View Try Yellow"...

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.790
Cathy- <i>san</i> !

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.870
Hello. I'm Cathy!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.160
Um, we're friends of Dilan...

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.200
Oh, the guy with the afro!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:40.450
You're engaged, right?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:44.120
I love all partners in VTY.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.910
I'm engaged to all of them!

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.910
So that's the deal...

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:52.620
Would you please meet him
and tell him exactly how you feel?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.120
--Otherwise he'll--
--There's no need.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:58.950
He and I are connected
in our hearts, for eternity.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.660
No, I mean...

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:04.950
You're the con artist who
took all Dilan's money, right?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.040
You annoy me, so I'm just
gonna come out and say it.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.830
This whole VTY thing's a scam, right?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:14.370
It's an MLM scam... I mean, operation!

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.620
You got engaged for money, right?

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:19.410
You slept with money.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:21.120
Shut up, girl.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.450
What's wrong with you?

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.330
Dilan? Of course I wasn't serious about him.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.040
Don't be stupid.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.000
Of course I wasn't serious about him.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.250
Don't be stupid.

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:39.950
All we have to do is just play this
back to him and the job's done.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.830
Why are you so down?

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:45.830
Well, when I think about how Dilan must feel...

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.290
I'm going to crush VTY.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:57.910
I don't want any more people
to suffer like Dilan did.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:00.540
I'll find evidence and take them to court.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.000
I'll help you! Let's go!

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.540
Stop it...

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:29.500
Pervert...

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.160
He's so cool, huh?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.700
Ever since Isshiki- <i>san</i> came,
everything's been going great!

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:39.870
Vision rain was his idea!

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.950
He's so smart!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.620
What floor do we go to?

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.080
The top floor. Let's go.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.330
Yes.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:01.290
Seems different up here.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.200
And I smell some kind of drug.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.790
This place looks sketchy as hell.

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:14.700
Looks like facial recognition.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.080
No, that won't work...

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:25.410
We found a great job, huh?

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:29.200
Yeah. Now I've got plenty of money
for my grand kids' allowance.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:33.370
You get paid just for pouring
water into a bottle, huh?

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:36.120
Nice and easy.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:41.160
Okay, if we submit this to the
consumer protection center....

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.330
I'm going to look for a little more.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.000
Why? We've got evidence.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.120
Mary- <i>san</i> , tell me.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.290
What else is it you're after?

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.620
Our dad is an asshole.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.910
"I'm going to buy cigarettes."

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:05.250
That was the last thing he said
before never coming back.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:10.790
When I saw this I couldn't believe it.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.950
He looked just like my dad.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.870
Is that why you took the job?

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.290
It's like...

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:25.000
My sister just got a boyfriend.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:29.040
If I could find Dad, she could tell him
they're getting married someday.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:32.830
And maybe she'd like that.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:38.750
But thank you. I was able
to come this far because of you.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.370
I'll go the rest of the way.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.450
No, I'll go with you.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.790
Let's find your dad.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.580
That's him...

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.700
You... What are you doing here?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:00.750
Kimiko.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.450
You always have the dumbest look on your face.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:06.450
You've been acting weird lately!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.620
The divorce papers were finalized.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:11.450
Stop acting like my husband.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.080
I'm going to the cops.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.370
Why?

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:16.370
The "rain of happiness" thing!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.370
Sorry. It's not Dad.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.370
It's insane!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.370
I see.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:22.080
This stuff is poison!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.000
Isshiki's lying to you!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.410
Wake up!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.500
You're the one who'll be waking up.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:31.450
Let me go, damn it!

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:36.040
The world will become a better place
by removing people like you.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:40.870
And that's what the rain of happiness is for.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:48.080
I'll send you to the vision world, personally.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.750
Don't worry.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.950
I've adjusted the proportions
so you won't suffer.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:53.830
Stop it!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:56.120
What are you doing?

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.450
Stop!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.160
You!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.790
Know your place!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:06.120
This isn't a place for
a beginner partner like you!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.750
"Partner" my ass!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.830
All the members of your
organization believe in you!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.370
How can you be plotting terrorism!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.290
John! I'm sorry!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.040
I won't let you interfere.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:25.200
The world will change soon!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.540
No!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.330
Does it hurt? Tell me, does it hurt?

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.580
I was lying when I said it wouldn't hurt!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.700
It's the other way around!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:55.080
I wanted to see your suffering!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:05.290
Now, you're next.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.080
I won't let you.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.000
John.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:14.200
Will you take the trip
to the vision world first?

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.200
Do it, Isshiki- <i>san</i> !

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.700
We'll follow you anywhere!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.700
Now cry! Scream!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:34.160
Suffer, suffer! Suffer!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:51.290
Hands up, Tetsuo Isshiki!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.870
Arrest them all!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.620
John...

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.370
Mary- <i>san</i> ... Are you okay?

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:18.080
I'm fine, so don't say a word.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.040
The ambulance is on its way.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.660
I see.

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:31.160
What's wrong?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.830
I'm saved! I'm saved!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:43.000
Sorry.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.700
Fascinating.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.160
Hey, old man.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.830
How'd you know this place was dangerous?

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:54.660
We just ran into Kyogoku, stinking of drugs.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:55.660
That's right.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:59.410
They say some guy named Isshiki
put a cloth up to his face

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:02.830
and he woke up on the sidewalk.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:06.040
This Isshiki guy was behind it all.

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:12.290
He's a pervert who's been drugging
his friends and family since he was little.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:15.910
Up till now, he's been lucky
enough to never get arrested.

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:18.370
But I knew he would screw up someday.

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:19.910
I expected this.

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.000
Hey, don't stop.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.120
Are you listening?

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:26.950
8020463840...

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.620
Don't do it!

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.870
Huh? What's going on?

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.910
What is this?

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:57.200
I can't believe he killed himself...

00:20:57.200 --> 00:21:01.830
Um, about all the stuff today... thank--

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:07.290
But I'm glad you weren't hurt.

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.290
But now we have to go tell Dilan.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.540
That's not gonna be fun.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:15.370
You're kind of like my sister.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.910
I'm like Lucy- <i>san</i> ?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:26.120
I went to an online study group.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:29.660
I'm going to introduce my
little sister to my VTY partner!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.950
You're pure and very serious.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.750
We'll be looking forward to your next visit.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.200
Hey.

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:52.330
I got the ticket from Watson- <i>san</i> .

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.910
Dilan.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:56.790
Your job helps a lot of people.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.450
See you.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.200
It happens sometimes.

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:03.370
Try harder next time, please!

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:09.790
Why? Why can't I get it up?

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.290
Hey, have you seen my underwear?

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:15.750
No. Now start cooking.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:14.330
The police arrested the CEO

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:15.750
as well as four other members

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:20.200
That's strange...

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:17.000
of the board of directors,

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:20.200
one of whom, Tetsuo Isshiki,

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:24.330
"VTY CEO's Secretary
Arrested For Murder, MLM Scam"

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:24.330
killed himself at the scene.

00:22:24.330 --> 00:22:28.250
Isshiki appears to have been directing
the others to commit acts of terrorism,

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:29.790
and the police are doing more investigations...

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:04.910
"Michel and the Stupid Book"

00:24:04.910 --> 00:24:06.870
"Welcome to VTY's Website"
"CEO Kimiko Goshogawara"
"Why Not Find a Job That Helps Others?"
"Have you ever thought about Vision?"
